WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Start in the Creative Archive.
Select the Higher Than Before album cover.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Choose Compare formats.
The album cover sits beside the release poster.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Notice how the tall edition gives
the same lettering more vertical room.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Press Escape to return to the contact sheet.
Select Release Poster.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.500
Choose Add to favourites.
Open Favourites to see your shortlist.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.500
Choose Export original and pick a destination.
Prints saves the original JPEG.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.000
The exported file matches the archive
original byte for byte.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.500
Return to the Creative Archive.
Press Command+F and type “bell” to find Fighter’s poster.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:47.000
Press Escape to clear Find.
Open Afterlight and look at The Last Horizon.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Choose Use in draft to open the study’s brief.
Edit the prompt here or copy it to your image tool.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Choose Save draft to keep the brief on this device.
You can do all of this offline.
